<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 14.1 percent in the week ended October 18, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>The volume of applications to refinance mortgages declined 12.3 percent, while applications to purchase mortgages slipped 14.7 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 2.6 percent to 316.4 from 324.8 in the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 5.2 percent to 179.2 from 189.1, it said.  </p>
